Start Windows shortcuts in the user's home

Purpose: the Start menu and desktop shortcuts started Rnote in the
install folder (Program Files), the default for Inno Setup icons.
Start in the user's home instead.

Approach: WorkingDir is the literal %USERPROFILE%, not an Inno
constant. Windows expands it at launch, so an all-users install still
starts each user in their own home.

Constraints: installer only (rnote_inno.iss.in).

